 in the demo carries into the full game.Du","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691406","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944880-1846651706682881","game_id":"steam-4944880","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch Minesweeper in 3D: Expert win, loss, and the 9","summary":"Cube Sweeper wraps Minesweeper around a 3D solid. Numbers count mines around corners and through tunnels, gems hide inside the cubes, and you turn the board to read it all.Watch a full Expert win, an Expert loss that ends in one boom, two Daily boards, and the rare 9. Then play it yourself: the demo is free, and everything you earn carries into the full game.Every board is certified solvable by pure logic, every mine and every gem. No guessing required.The full game launches November 5. Wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T19:23:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944880-1845383656389894","game_id":"steam-4944880","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo now runs on Mac","summary":"The free Cube Sweeper demo now runs on Mac as well as Windows. It is the same demo on both, built for Apple silicon and Intel Macs. Cube Sweeper is Minesweeper played on the surface of a 3D solid. You orbit the board, read the numbers around corners, and dig out the gems hidden inside the cubes. Every board is certified solvable by pure logic, every mine and every gem. No guessing. New in this update: the Gallery The points you score now build trophies, one tile per point. There are nine of them","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T20:02:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944880-1843481262700782","game_id":"steam-4944880","kind":"announcement","title":"Cube Sweeper is in Steam Next Fest this October","summary":"Cube Sweeper is part of Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26, 2026. The free demo stays open through the fest. It is available now, so there is no need to wait for the fest to start. Every board in the demo is generated and certified exactly like the full game's. Cube Sweeper is Minesweeper played on the surface of a 3D solid: you orbit the board and read the numbers around corners. Every board is certified solvable by pure logic, every mine and every hidden gem. No guessing. During the fest I will","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T06:01:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700782","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4944880-1842212951303777","game_id":"steam-4944880","kind":"announcement","title":"The free demo is out now","summary":"The free Cube Sweeper demo is live on Steam today. Cube Sweeper is Minesweeper carved into a 3D solid: you orbit the board and read the numbers around corners. The demo is a real piece of the game, not a guided tour: every board in it is generated and certified exactly like the full game's. What the demo holdsUnlimited Easy boards. Learn the surface before it starts folding. Eight Intermediate and eight Professional boards, the carved tiers where numbers reach around corners. Replay each as ofte","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T16:41:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951303777","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:11:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4944880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4944880":"2026-10-26T05:32:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4944880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4980040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:32:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4944880","app_id":4944880,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"781d8ec20afc12a37df16e329de782b596f600b103d1416ab5ec1bfb056f600c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Classic Minesweeper, carved into three dimensions. Orbit each board and read the numbers around corners and down through tunnels. Every board is guaranteed solvable by logic alone, never a guess. Dig for hidden gems and climb from your first click to Expert.","publishers":[{"name":"Hinten Software"}],"developers":[{"name":"Hinten Software"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793901600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790658442","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4944880/184484194/f4f4dc80fa6576b8679ece7b3c01ce4864349c5e/1790656248/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"4944880/184484194/f4f4dc80fa6576b8679ece7b3c01ce48643